    tbox:uses fe:ModelOfComputation ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :Coding ;
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer_programming> ;
    rdfs:comment "The software engineering activity of creating computer programs by writing, testing, and maintaining source code in a programming language."@en .

:ProjectPlanning a tbox:ConceptualEntity ;
