    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_requirements_specification> ;
    rdfs:comment "An engineering activity concerned with specifying and documenting the requirements for a software system, producing a requirements artifact with the support of requirements specification languages and tools."@en .

:RequirementsValidation a tbox:ConceptualEntity ;
